00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:57.510
It gives your app
continuity across devices

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.940
and can drive net new installs.

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:03.990
If the user is doing something
on your app on their mobile,

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.990
like listening to a podcast
or reading an article

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:11.190
or writing a message, and
they sit down at their PC,

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.800
to continue their app activity

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.340
on their PC is what
