00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:37.770
You see that?

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:42.240
Spotify just appeared on user's
taskbar with that phone badge.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:43.470
That badge just showed

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:46.650
up because Spotify
published a resume context.

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:50.250
Windows received it and surfaced
this nudge to the user.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.440
And with one click,
the same album

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.450
and sent the same timestamp.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.630
Now, where it appears
on the user's device.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.580
Now, here's where it
gets really interesting

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:01.290
for you as a developer.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.590
What if user doesn't have
Spotify on their PC?

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:07.140
Resume badge will
